 journey or feel the same way or  feel differently i would love to read  about your experience in the comments  below or if you just want to geek out  about your favorite zelda game feel free  to place that down there as well if  you'd like for me to make more videos  where i review games or talk about my  experiences also let me know because  there's a lot of opinions that are up  here in this noggin of mine and i can  talk for a long time subscribe if you  haven't already to stick around for all  sorts of new videos about new video  games to come and a hearty welcome to  the newest member of my bandit crew  donnie j that's about all i've got for  this one so as always i hope you have a  wonderful rest of your day this is  bandit looking forward to seeing you  next time and signing out  [Music]  you
 

